led when Nuno Mendes was sent off following heavy protests. The final moments were punctuated by a flurry of yellow cards for Achraf Hakimi and Fabian Ruiz as tempers flared. Ultimately, in front of a crowd of 38,223, Lens survived late scares from Dembele to secure a famous victory and lift the trophy."
